            Joke("I asked a friend to find me a little house. He took a long time.", "So I moved into a jar. I am still waiting for his answer."),
            Joke("In summer I roll in hot sand. In winter I hug cold statues.", "It makes a man tough. You push a rock uphill in all weathers. Show-off."),
            Joke("Plato sailed to Sicily for fine dinners, and ate olives there.", "I asked him: Do olives not grow in Athens?"),
            Joke("I offered Plato a share of my dried figs. He ate them all.", "I said: I asked you to share them, not to finish them."),
