            Joke("They scold me for going into dirty places.", "The sun shines into dirty places too, and it stays clean."),
            Joke("The Athenians voted to call Alexander a god.", "I said: Then vote me a god too. I will not need a temple. I have a jar."),
            Joke("A man said: You know nothing, and you call yourself wise.", "I said: Even to reach for wisdom is wisdom. You reach for the top every day."),
