            Joke("A man asked: Why do you drink in a tavern, Diogenes?", "I asked him: Why do you get your hair cut at a barber's?"),
            Joke("I asked a big spender for a fortune. Others, for an obol.", "Why? The others will give again. He will soon have nothing left."),
