            Joke("I saw a very bad archer at practice.", "So I sat down right next to the target. It was the safest spot."),
            Joke("Alexander asked me: Are you not afraid of me?", "I asked: Are you good or bad? He said: Good. Then who fears the good?"),
            Joke("Learning keeps the young in line, and comforts the old.", "It is wealth to the poor, and an ornament to the rich. And it weighs nothing."),
            Joke("Riddle: what is the finest thing in the world?", "Free speech. So I will say it: your rock could do with a wash."),
            Joke("I saw a school with many statues of the Muses, and few pupils.", "I said: With the gods' help, teacher, you have a full class."),
            Joke("If breakfast is fine, then breakfast in the market is fine.", "That is logic. And if it is fine to push a rock, it is fine to push it uphill."),
            Joke("Nothing in life comes right without hard practice.", "And practice can beat anything. You have practiced for a very long time."),
            Joke("When you are used to it, giving up pleasure is a joy.", "You gave up rest long ago. You must be a very happy man by now."),
            Joke("I live as Heracles lived: freedom above all.", "He had twelve labors, and then he was free. You have one. Take your time."),
            Joke("My friends wanted to buy my freedom. I called them fools.", "A lion is no slave to the man who feeds him. The man fears the lion."),
            Joke("A man sent his son to Athens to hear me. The boy stayed.", "He sent his other son to fetch him. He stayed. Then he came, and stayed too."),
