            Joke("If you ever want to stop, I know a good jar.", "Round, cheap, and flat inside. Not a hill in it."),
            Joke("A dog is honest, sleeps anywhere, and loves a bone.", "That is why they call me the Dog. Two out of three so far."),
            Joke("People call me Dog to make me cross.", "So I sit up and give them my paw. Nothing makes them more cross."),
            Joke("Cerberus guards a gate with three heads.", "I guard a jar with one. Nobody has ever got into my jar. I must be good."),
